{"symbol":"AMB.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:46:50Z","info":{"address1":"Pulawska 336","city":"Warsaw","zip":"02-819","country":"Poland","phone":"48 225 66 33 00","fax":"48 225 66 33 03","website":"https://www.ambra.com.pl","industry":"Beverages - Wineries & Distilleries","industryKey":"beverages-wineries-distilleries","industryDisp":"Beverages - Wineries & Distilleries","sector":"Consumer Defensive","sectorKey":"consumer-defensive","sectorDisp":"Consumer Defensive","longBusinessSummary":"Ambra S.A., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture, import, and distribution of grape wines in Poland, the Czech Republic, Slovakia, and Romania. It offers sparkling and carbonated wines, table and flavored wines, champagne type soft drinks, meads, and ciders, as well as other alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. The company offers its products under the CIN&CIN, DORATO, EL SOL, FRESCO, PLISKA, PICCOLO, CYDR LUBELSKI, WINIARNIA ZAMOJSKA, SLANTSCHEW BRJAG, ROBBY BUBBLE, ROSSIJSKOE IGRISTOE, FLY SEKT, ZAREA, MILCOV, CARPATEN, and CORRIDO brand names. It supplies its products to shops, distribution networks, and wholesalers, as well as offers products through its online store Winezja.pl. Ambra S.A. was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland. Ambra S.A. is a subsidiary of Schloss Wachenheim AG.","fullTimeEmployees":999,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert Piotr Ogór","title":"President of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Kazmierczak","title":"VP of the Management Board & CFO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Grzegorz Stanislaw Nowak","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":18.38,"open":18.38,"dayLow":17.9,"dayHigh":18.4,"regularMarketPreviousClose":18.38,"regularMarketOpen":18.38,"regularMarketDayLow":17.9,"regularMarket